(The first patch announcement for 3.4.2, I suppose?)

I just checked that my logmoves and showborn patches for 3.4.1 still work
with 3.4.2. However, some line numbers have changed in the source, so I
made new diffs to get rid of those warnings.

The "logmoves" patch appends the move counter at the end of the record /
logfile entry in curly braces, and possible information about explore or
wizard mode as {exp} or {wiz} after that.

The "showborn" patch optionally shows the number of monsters born in the
vanquished list when the game ends, after the number of those monsters
killed, if it is different from the kill counter. 
The born counter is not shown if it is the same as the kill counter, and
neither is it shown for monsters that you haven't killed any.

Both patches are now downloadable at
http://www.netsonic.fi/~walker/nethack.html 
as the previous ones have been.

